  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nIf √225 = 15, then the value of √2.25 + √0.0225 + √0.000225 is:\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n√(a × 10²ⁿ) = √a × 10ⁿ\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n√2.25 = √(225 × 10⁻²)\n\n⇒ √225 × 10⁻¹\n\n⇒ 15 × 0.1\n\n⇒ 1.5\n\n√0.0225 = √(225 × 10⁻⁴)\n\n⇒ √225 × 10⁻²\n\n⇒ 15 × 0.01\n\n⇒ 0.15\n\n√0.000225 = √(225 × 10⁻⁶)\n\n⇒ √225 × 10⁻³\n\n⇒ 15 × 0.001\n\n⇒ 0.015\n\nTherefore, √2.25 + √0.0225 + √0.000225\n\n⇒ 1.5 + 0.15 + 0.015\n\n⇒ 1.665\n\n**The correct answer is option 3.**",
